OL,3,GNEWSAResidents report ongoing postal
OL,4,Adelays
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people in parts of the South West
OL,7,Fsay they are currently getting Royal
OL,8,FMail post delivered about once a
OL,9,Ffortnight.
OL,11,FThe BBC has been contacted by people in
OL,12,Fthe region, frustrated they are missing
OL,13,Fhospital appointments, bank cards are
OL,14,Fbeing cancelled and debt collection
OL,15,Fthreats are being issued because of
OL,16,Flate parking fines.
OL,18,FTorbay MP Steve Darling told Parliament
OL,19,Fthe problems were affecting people's
OL,20,Fhealth, citing missed medical
OL,21,Fappointments caused by delayed mail.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
