OL,3,GNEWSAResidents report ongoing postal
OL,4,Adelays
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail said it had experienced
OL,7,F"short-term local challenges" in the
OL,8,Farea but had "taken steps to improve
OL,9,Fperformance".
